---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Mindful is not a substitute for professional mental-health care."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase">Disclaimer</p>
      <h1
        class="mt-4 text-5xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-6xl"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;"
      >
        Not a substitute for care.
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The essays on Mindful are shared for general reading and reflection. They are not medical,
        psychological, or therapeutic advice, and they should not be used to diagnose or treat any
        condition.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you are struggling, a qualified professional can offer support that is specific to your
        situation &mdash; something a short essay simply cannot do.
      </p>

      <h2>In crisis</h2>
      <p>
        If you are in immediate danger, please contact your local emergency services. Many countries
        also have dedicated mental-health helplines available by phone, text, or chat.
      </p>

      <h2>A note on links</h2>
      <p>
        Mindful does not currently include affiliate links, advertisements, or sponsored content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
